        "raw": "<p>Hazard spaces activate when you are on them.</p><p>Lava deals more damage if there is lava adjacent, but you still trigger it only when you are on the space.</p><p>Cards like Burning tornado and Turret Bot create hazard spaces around them, the radius tells you how far out the hazard spaces go.</p><p>Turret Bot creates Hazard spaces in a radius of 2, so 2 spaces in any direction from Turret Bot is a hazard Space.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To sum up:</p><p>1. &nbsp;You have to be on a hazard space to trigger it.</p><p>2. &nbsp;Things that crate a hazard space will tell you how far out they create them with the radius.</p><p>Bonus: &nbsp;Objects that create hazard spaces still use Line of Sight to attack.</p>",
